{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "You mean Jester.": "",
  "Yeah. He was a genius. He knew how to execute a plan.": "",
  "We owe it all to him that we got big enough to gain a following.": "",
  "Yeah, and then he left you high and dry when you got too greedy.": "",
  "Yep. He was all about punishing social injustice. Always acting so high and mighty.": "",
  "Then what makes you think he'll help you on this fraud heist?": "",
  "Who knows? If he saw what a payday it's gonna be, even he might have a change of heart.": "",
  "And if he didn't?": "",
  "Then... I guess we'd be parting ways. Permanently.": "",
  "Sounds like that was your plan from the beginning. I take it you planned on getting rid of me too?": "",
  "Of course. Especially now that you know what I've told you. I'm afraid your time has come!": "",
  "Yeah right. I took your job, and I expect to get paid!": "",
  "You need to disband your little group before you do anything really stupid.": "",
  "And I think you owe an apology to everyone who joined you thinking you were some righteous bandit.": "",
  "Ergh... I'll end it, man...": "",
  "If you ever see Jester... And he's still out there playing the hero...": "",
  "Can you tell him to take it down a notch?": "",
  "He's over-extending himself. I don't really know what fuels his rage against injustice...": "",
  "Probably some tragic shit in his past... But he's gotta stop. He'll get caught.": "",
  "...All right. I'll talk to him.": "",
  "I'll put the money directly into your bank account. Later.": "",
  "(Well, this didn't get me any closer to Jester...)": "",
  "(But I think I learned a few things about him all the same...)": "",
  "Tch, looks like we got company. Bring him down too!": "",
  "You call <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> evidence?": "",
  "(What? Oh shit, that's not right.)": "",
  "No, sorry. But I do have something better.": "",
  "Your claim that you thieves are so righteous is a lie, and here's the proof.": "",
  "Hm? What the heck is that?": "",
  "I have something better.": "",
  "You're lying when you say you don't keep the money. And this is the proof.": "",
  "(I've gotta get to him before he bails!)": "",
  "Welcome. Oh my... Pardon me, sir, but that piece of art you're carrying! It's absolutely astonishing!": "",
  "...Ah, how impolite of me. My name is Fukutsu, and I'm the manager here.": "",
  "Oh. Nice to meet you.": "",
  "May I ask your name, sir?": "",
  "A question, Yagami-sama. Would you please sell us that painting you have with you?": "",
  "You mean... this?": "",
  "Yes, that's an original by Fuka Shiranui.": "",
  "...An original by <font_kind=yakuza_italic>who</font_kind>-ka?": "",
  "I figured you hadn't heard of him. Although he is Japan's top painter, he rarely shows his face in public.": "",
  "His abstract paintings possess a unique force that draws people in, no matter their expertise on the subject.": "",
  "We aim to emphasize more of Fuka Shiranui's pieces here.": "",
  "So please consider selling us his painting. We can pay quite a hefty sum for it, you know.": "",
  "(Well, it's not like it's any use to me...)": "",
  "Welcome. Oh my... That painting you have there!": "",
  "It's by Fuka Shiranui, is it not? Would you mind letting us take it off your hands?": "",
  "(I doubt I'll hang it up in the office any time soon. Should I sell this to Ebisu Pawn then?)": "",
  "Yagami-san, would you please consider selling us that Fuka Shiranui painting?": "",
  "We'll pay quite the hefty sum for it.": "",
  "Thank you for letting us have that painting!": "",
  "Not a problem. It's better off in your hands than mine.": "",
  "If you ever get your hands on another one, please don't hesitate to stop by.": "",
  "Thank you. I await your return with bated breath!": "",
  "Yagami-san, I'm astounded. I never imagined you'd be able to procure this many Fuka Shiranui originals for us.": "",
  "Well, I didn't do much. I kind of just stumbled across them.": "",
  "Either way, I want to show you my full gratitude.": "",
  "How about every time you bring in an item for appraisal, I'll increase its value by ten percent?": "",
  "What? You sure you can just do that?": "",
  "Of course, it's the least I can do.": "",
  "Wow, thanks so much!": "",
  "My pleasure. I shall eagerly await your return.": "",
  "What's wrong, Amane-san? You okay?": "",
  "I am not the one who requires your aid. You must go after the great calamity.": "",
  "Woah, woah. You sure you're okay...?": "",
  "Can you try to walk me through what happened?": "",
  "I witnessed a great calamity on a passerby, but when I warned him, he lashed out at me...": "",
  "He told me I was annoyingly persistent.": "",
  "Persistent? Why would he say that?": "",
  "Because I foresaw his future about a month ago as well. A calamity of fire.": "",
  "And when I saw him again earlier...": "",
  "I couldn't help but notice how alarmingly large the aura of his calamity had become.": "",
  "A calamity's aura can change size?": "",
  "I've never seen anything like it, to be frank. So I warned him again...": "",
  "And that's when he attacked you, huh? From his perspective, you probably seemed like a scammer or something.": "",
  "Regardless... A calamity of that magnitude, I cannot even imagine the havoc it may reap.": "",
  "And as a calamity of fire... It could have horrifying consequences.": "",
  "Let me guess, you want me to tail him and prevent the calamity.": "",
  "Yes. I require your services now more than ever. Will your usual 15,000 yen suffice?": "",
  "Yeah, that's fine. Anything you can tell me to help identify the guy?": "",
  "He was a plump man with short, black hair who was wearing an embroidered stadium jacket and a large backpack.": "",
  "I know that his name is Hiyama-san. After he hit me, he headed toward Showa Street.": "",
  "All right. I'll go look for him.": "",
  "(That's him... A calamity of fire this time, huh?)": "",
  "(I don't really know what to expect here...)": "",
  "(Little Asia...? It's under construction. What business would he have going there?)": "",
  "Heh heh... This area burns so well...": "",
  "(Is that... gasoline I smell?)": "",
  "Hey! What are you doing!?": "",
  "What do you want!? I'm trying to start something here, so stay out of my way, would you!?": "",
  "Arson, eh? You're not the victim of the fire calamity, you're the catalyst...": "",
  "Did that fortune-teller send you here? She freaked me out. I thought she was onto me...": "",
  "Yeah, and it's thanks to her that I can prevent you from doing this.": "",
  "You aren't preventing shit! I'll be the next one to turn Kamurocho into a sea of flames!": "",
  "And Little Asia will be the beacon that signals the coming storm!": "",
  "Dude, you're nuts. So how about you shut up and let me kick your ass?": "",
  "Who knows, maybe it'll knock some sense into you.": "",
  "...Oh? Fine! Then your body can be the kindling! I've always wanted to watch someone go up in flames!": "",
  "(She was right on the money yet again... I'm starting to wonder if maybe I shouldn't be doubting her.)": "",
  "Thank you for calling us.": "",
  "That guy's a wanted arsonist.": "",
  "We can't let Little Asia go up in flames ever again. It would be a huge disaster.": "",
  "Yeah. I'm just glad it didn't come to that.": "",
  "That said, I'm surprised you found him here. This area's pretty shut off.": "",
  "Well... He seemed pretty suspicious, so I followed him here.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Thank you. You managed to prevent a major disaster in this city.": "",
  "I guess. Didn't expect the guy to be the perpetrator, though.": "",
  "He was babbling about turning Kamurocho into a sea of flames.": "",
  "If my power was able to save lives today, then there is little more I can ask for. Except...": "",
  "Yagami-san... How would you feel about forming a partnership?": "",
  "What? A partnership?": "",
  "I predict the calamities, and you minimize the damage. I think we've proven that we're an effective team.": "",
  "Haha, tempting, but I think the current arrangement is working out just fine.": "",
  "Besides, you know how stressed I'd be hanging out with a prophet all the time?": "",
  "Very well... I can't say I'm not disappointed, but I do understand.": "",
  "Here, your payment. Perhaps something longer term may be in our future yet.": "",
  "Sorry, but I've got too much going on right now.": "",
  "I see. I do hope you'll reconsider.": "",
  "If you do, come see me immediately.": "",
  "(All right. Gotta find this guy...)": "",
  "(In other words, she needs me to look into this guy. Should I accept?)": "",
  "(I should've leave yet. I haven't found Hiyama.)": "",
  "Huh? Aren't you... Katagiri-san?": "",
  "Ah, if it isn't Yagami-san. What a pleasant surprise.": "",
  "Care for a drink? It's on me.": "",
  "Yeah? Then, don't mind if I do.": "",
  "By the way. Kawada-san from Cloudy Skies Publishing tells me you're a detective.": "",
  "He's not wrong.": "",
  "Mind sharing some of your experiences with me, then? I bet you'd be the perfect reference for my new detective novel.": "",
  "You're the one buying drinks, I don't see why not.": "",
  "Splendid. Why don't we start with a case that's left a deep impression on you? Something... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>unforgettable</font_kind>.": "",
  "Hmm... Let's see.": "",
  "(What case would be good inspiration for a detective novel?)": "",
  "There was this time I had to stop a serial bomber. The situation nearly blew up in my face.": "",
  "You mean you were the one who solved that?": "",
  "...And once he got fired, he decided to plant bombs all over town as his way of sticking it to his former employer.": "",
  "That's terrible. No wonder they withheld the details from the public. Sometimes truth really is stranger than fiction.": "",
  "Ever heard of Kamurocho's infamous Twisted Trio?": "",
  "No, but do go on!": "",
  "Well, they were basically a bunch of perverts, and...": "",
  "...Each of them acted independently, but society lumped them together as one. That's why they're called the Twisted Trio.": "",
  "That's... fascinating! I might have to change a few details here and there, but yes. Brilliant.": "",
  "There was this amazing fortune teller I ran into a couple times.": "",
  "It was like she actually had the power to sense bad luck on a person.": "",
  "That does sound amazing.": "",
  "However...": "",
  "...Kamurocho was about to be swallowed in a sea of flames.": "",
  "How frightening. Yet, I'm rather curious as to what my fortune would be...": "",
  "I was once asked to catch a ghost that supposedly appeared in someone's new apartment...": "",
  "How is that even possible?": "",
  "...It turns out this so-called ghost was actually the client's girlfriend.": "",
  "Haha, oh wow. Sounds like one hell of a couple.": "",
  "One time, there was this fish pond called Koi Bride where many of the fish mysteriously turned into sashimi.": "",
  "...So many of the fish ended up being cut and cleaned just because one of them ate a diamond ring.": "",
  "Wow. It is pretty impressive that so many of the pond's fish ended up sliced and diced like delicacies.": "",
  "I once had to look for a cat named Zhuang Shi...": "",
  "You were looking for a lost cat. As an actual case.": "",
  "Well, yes, but...": "",
  "...The cat was actually a clue about the boss's hidden fortune.": "",
  "Then perhaps Wang-san is a very wealthy man by now!": "",
  "Do you know about Ono Michio?": "",
  "Ono Michio? You mean that mascot from Hiroshima?": "",
  "That's the one. Someone wore his costume during a robbery...": "",
  "...So I managed to hunt down the culprit.": "",
  "Pulling off a robbery dressed as a mascot... I don't know if that's daring or just plain dumb.": "",
  "Did you hear what happened to Gamo, the guy who escaped from prison?": "",
  "Yes, I heard he recently got arrested.": "",
  "I'm the one that caught him.": "",
  "Get outta town! You did?": "",
  "...Turns out he just wanted a decent hamburger. I didn't get a bad vibe from him.": "",
  "So he wasn't the dangerous criminal they were portraying all over the news... Must've been a damn good burger.": "",
  "If you have another interesting case to share, please tell me all about it! I'm here whenever I get writer's block.": "",
  "Sure thing! Then I'll see you next time.": "",
  "Ah, nice to see you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hey there, Katagiri-san. Mind if I join?": "",
  "The more the merrier. Come on over.": "",
  "Yagami-san, would you be willing to share any interesting cases with me today?": "",
  "Sure thing. Let's see...": "",
  "If you have another interesting case to share, please let me know! I'll probably be here, washing away my writer's block.": "",
  "Thank you for sharing all these valuable experiences with me. They're excellent story material, to say the least.": "",
  "I hope you don't think I'm downplaying all your hard work, but you may have just inspired the next best-seller.": "",
  "I'm sure Kawada-san will be happy to hear that.": "",
  "I should hope so. He's always the first to read my work, so as long as it makes it past him, my book is in the clear.": "",
  "Heh, sounds like he's one tough customer.": "",
  "But I'm sure your novel won't disappoint. I'm looking forward to reading it too.": "",
  "Haha, then I'll get right to work. Talk to you later.": "",
  "Take care, Katagiri-san.": "",
  "Welcome to Poppo. Would you be interested in learning about the music fair we're holding?": "",
  "Well, with every 700 yen purchase you make, you'll earn a single point. Collect 10 of them to earn a fantastic prize.": "",
  "A limited-edition record that's sure to brighten your day.": "",
  "On top of that, each of our branches carries a different record, so please visit us at any store you like.": "",
  "You're welcome to try it out anytime.": "",
  "Thank you for stopping by. With today's purchase, your points have gone up by <t:get_poppo_point>. ": "",
  "You currently have a <t:now_poppo_point=friend_034_kizuna_point>-point total.": "",
  "If you gather 10 points, we'll present you with a record.": "",
  "It seems you've gathered 10 points. Allow me to present your prize.": "",
  "Oh, awesome!": "",
  "Here you go. Please enjoy our limited-edition record.": "",
  "Welcome! Would you like to try our music fair today?": "",
  "A music fair?": "",
  "That's right! Get one point for every 700 yen you spend! Once you get 10 points, we'll give you a nice new record!": "",
  "A record? Like an LP?": "",
  "Remember to do lots of shopping at Poppo!": "",
  "Thanks! With today's purchase, your points have gone up by <t:get_poppo_point>.": "",
  "You now have a <t:now_poppo_point=friend_035_kizuna_point>-point total!": "",
  "Remember to always do your shopping at Poppo!": "",
  "Congratulations! You managed to reach 10 points!": "",
  "Heck yeah!": "",
  "Here's our limited-edition record!": "",
  "Thanks again! And remember, always shop Poppo!": "",
  "Yes. Furthermore, each Poppo in Kamurocho has a different record to give away.": "",
  "If you gather 10 points, we'll give you a nice new record!": "",
  "So, what can I do for you?": "",
  "Well... It's about my daughter-in-law. That is, my son's wife.": "",
  "Her name is Kiriko, and... How should I put this? She scares the daylight out of me.": "",
  "She scares you? Why?": "",
  "Ever since their marriage, my son seems to have become rather... unlucky.": "",
  "To give you a few examples, he was almost run over, he nearly died of carbon monoxide poisoning from a stove...": "",
  "While he was asleep, the apartment caught fire, and the brakes on his car suddenly gave out.": "",
  "He survived all of that!?": "",
  "I'm thankful that he has, but as you can see, something's not right!": "",
  "Yeah, I'd say those are some unusual circumstances.": "",
  "And I can't help but think that his wife is behind it all.": "",
  "Do you have any reason to suspect her?": "",
  "Well, as I said, all of this started happening after they married.": "",
  "And he's also taken out a rather large life insurance policy at her suggestion...": "",
  "(These are certainly telltale signs, but it doesn't sound like she has anything concrete...)": "",
  "On top of it all, my son has become ill lately. He's constantly complaining of stomach pains and nausea.": "",
  "I can't help but think that his wife may be mixing something into his food...": "",
  "I know I could be overthinking all of this... But once the thought entered my head, I couldn't escape it.": "",
  "No, they're all valid concerns.": "",
  "I take it your son doesn't suspect his wife at all?": "",
  "Oh, quite right. He's head over heels for her.": "",
  "That's why I came to you to investigate her, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'd like you to confirm if she's really capable of this, or if I'm imagining things.": "",
  "That's clear enough. But out of curiosity, does your son know about this request?": "",
  "Actually, I did tell him.": "",
  "He objected of course, but he eventually allowed it if this is what it would take for me to trust Kiriko-san.": "",
  "Great. Then it won't be a problem if I discuss things with him.": "",
  "Also, could I trouble you for a photo of your son and his wife?": "",
  "Kiriko-san works at the M Side Cafe in Kamurocho. You're bound to run into her there.": "",
  "My fee for this type of case is 80,000 yen. Is that acceptable, Ma'am?": "",
  "Of course. I'll leave you to it, then.": "",
  "(All right, time to get started. I should find Kiriko Kuwayama at M Side Cafe.)": "",
  "(That's probably Kiriko Kuwayama.)": "",
  "Sir? I noticed you staring... Another one of Kiriko's admirers?": "",
  "She gets more popular every day.": "",
  "She's that popular, huh?": "",
  "Oh yes, she's a real enchantress. Talk to her once, and you'll be head over heels.": "",
  "What a shame that she's married! Get too close, and it'll only end in pain.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "May I ask your name, sir?": "ขอทราบชื่อคุณลูกค้าได้ไหมคะ?",
  "Hey! What are you doing!?": "เฮ้ย! ทำอะไรน่ะ!?",
  "Hmm... Let's see.": "อืม... ไหนดูซิ",
  "However...": "อย่างไรก็ตาม...",
  "How is that even possible?": "มันเป็นไปได้ยังไงกัน?",
  "Heck yeah!": "ใช่เลย!",
  "Thanks again! And remember, always shop Poppo!": "ขอบคุณอีกครั้งค่ะ! แล้วอย่าลืมนะคะ ช้อปที่ป๊อปโป้เสมอ!"
 }
}
